{"pin":"BH01873","subcodes":[{"code":"BH01873","anchor":"","first_line":"Sanctified praise, transcending all mention and utterance, befitteth Him Who is the Purpose of all creation, Who through one blessed and exalted Word [3.5s]... ...Praise be to Thee, O Lord my God, for guiding me unto the horizon of Thy Revelation and for causing me to be mentioned by Thy Name.","first_line_orig":"حمد مقدس از ذکر و بیان مقصود امکان را لایق و سزاست که بیک کلمه مبارکه علیا  ","language":"mixed","word_count":"470","translations":[],"refs":[{"kind":"manuscript","code":"BLIB_Or15690.100","source":"BLIB_Or15690","locator":"100"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"BLIB_Or15728.147","source":"BLIB_Or15728","locator":"147"},{"kind":"publication","code":"ADM3#133x p.150","source":"ADM3","locator":"133x p.150","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/559.pdf#page=1"},{"kind":"publication","code":"ADM3#134 p.151x","source":"ADM3","locator":"134 p.151x","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/559.pdf#page=152"},{"kind":"publication","code":"BRL_DA#003","source":"BRL_DA","locator":"003","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/029395007"},{"kind":"publication","code":"PYB#122 p.04x","source":"PYB","locator":"122 p.04x","url":"http://www.h-net.org/~bahai/diglib/Periodicals/Payam_i_Bahai/122.PDF#page=4"},{"kind":"translation","code":"ADJ.080x","source":"ADJ","locator":"080x","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/153777598"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BLO_PT#072x","source":"BLO_PT","locator":"072x","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahaullah_munajat_abu_fadl"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BRL_APBH#05x","source":"BRL_APBH","locator":"05x","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/301701477"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BRL_APBH#06x","source":"BRL_APBH","locator":"06x","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/908556715"},{"kind":"translation","code":"JHT_S#004x","source":"JHT_S","locator":"004x","url":"https://joshuahalltranslations.com/jalal/2017/10/Supplications-by-Bahaullah-1.pdf#page=2"},{"kind":"translation","code":"SW_v14#06 p.166